{"organizations": [], "uuid": "ce4c1643b781b805c3d1bca936a0b146d6ca98f7", "thread": {"social": {"gplus": {"shares": 0}, "pinterest": {"shares": 0}, "vk": {"shares": 0}, "linkedin": {"shares": 0}, "facebook": {"likes": 0, "shares": 0, "comments": 0}, "stumbledupon": {"shares": 0}}, "site_full": "hk.finance.yahoo.com", "main_image": "https://s.yimg.com/uu/api/res/1.2/ymN0mV9kQAqYEpxBCN9cdw--~B/aD04NTM7dz0xMjgwO3NtPTE7YXBwaWQ9eXRhY2h5b24-/http://media.zenfs.com/en/homerun/feed_manager_auto_publish_494/dc5ed3c461b39a9f1ce14653bb0fe7f2", "site_section": "https://hk.finance.yahoo.com/personal-finance", "section_title": "個人理財 - Yahoo 財經", "url": "https://hk.finance.yahoo.com/news/%E4%B8%B2%E6%B5%81%E5%AA%92%E9%AB%94%E6%99%82%E4%BB%A3%E9%9F%B3%E6%A8%82%E7%9B%9C%E7%89%88%E6%AF%94%E7%8E%87%E4%BB%8D%E4%BD%94%E8%BF%91%E5%9B%9B%E6%88%90-035932231.html", "country": "US", "domain_rank": 5, "title": "串流媒體時代音樂盜版比率仍佔近四成", "performance_score": 0, "site": "yahoo.com", "participants_count": 1, "title_full": "", "spam_score": 0.115, "site_type": "news", "published": "2018-10-10T11:59:00.000+03:00", "replies_count": 0, "uuid": "ce4c1643b781b805c3d1bca936a0b146d6ca98f7"}, "author": "華爾街日報", "url": "https://hk.finance.yahoo.com/news/%E4%B8%B2%E6%B5%81%E5%AA%92%E9%AB%94%E6%99%82%E4%BB%A3%E9%9F%B3%E6%A8%82%E7%9B%9C%E7%89%88%E6%AF%94%E7%8E%87%E4%BB%8D%E4%BD%94%E8%BF%91%E5%9B%9B%E6%88%90-035932231.html", "ord_in_thread": 0, "title": "串流媒體時代音樂盜版比率仍佔近四成", "locations": [], "entities": {"persons": [], "locations": [], "organizations": []}, "highlightText": "", "language": "chineset", "persons": [], "text": "2017年，全球唱片音樂收入增長8.1%，但整體産業仍受盜版問題困擾。 圖片來源：JENNY KANE/ASSOCIATED PRESS 更多 國際唱片業協會(International Federation of the Phonographic Industry, 簡稱IFPI)周二(2018年10月9日)發布報告指出，雖然Spotify Technology SA (SPOT)和蘋果公司(Apple Inc., AAPL)的Apple Music透過讓粉絲付費使得音樂行業恢復增長，但盜版比率依然高企。\n這份報告的結論是，盜版方式已經隨着用戶合法收聽音樂習慣的變化而改變，且盜版正在阻礙訂戶市場的增長潛力。發言人指出，有86%的消費者透過Spotify、蘋果及其他公司提供的點播服務收聽音樂，其中大約38%的人透過侵權方式獲取音樂，近年來這一比例一直居高不下。\n獲取盜版音樂的用戶佔整體消費者群體的32%，而這其中大多數使用一種被稱為 「串串流媒體翻錄」(stream ripping)的技術。串流媒體翻錄網站可以從YouTube影片或類似來源盜錄音樂，並在用戶電腦上創建音檔文件。這些網站一般通過廣告賺取收入，而不向音樂人或唱片公司支付報酬。YouTube對此未有回應。\n上述IFPI發言人表示，串流媒體翻錄也損害了流媒體服務向訂戶提供離線音樂的付費業務，這正在阻礙合法音樂市場的發展。\n（本文版權歸道瓊斯公司所有，未經許可不得翻譯或轉載。）\n更多精彩文章：\n王毅與蓬佩奧激烈交鋒 中美關係進一步惡化\n中美貿易戰催生中國出口商找到避稅新途徑\n中國股市大跌，投資者情緒悲觀\n中國貨幣寬鬆政策治標不治本？\n香港銀行間人民幣借款成本飆升，促增長措施令人民幣承壓", "external_links": ["https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-FIN-20181010073259", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BGH-20181009121159", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-FIN-20181010073259&quot;", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BGH-20181009092217&quot;", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-HRD-20181009112512&quot;", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-MKT-20181008150454&quot;", "https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/wg5Ri1Dabb2KobhYfL789Q--~A/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjtzbT0xO3c9NjM3O2g9NDI1/http://media.zenfs.com/en/homerun/feed_manager_auto_publish_494/dc5ed3c461b39a9f1ce14653bb0fe7f2", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BGH-20181009092217", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-HRD-20181009112512", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-MKT-20181008150454", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BGH-20181009121159&quot;"], "published": "2018-10-10T11:59:00.000+03:00", "crawled": "2018-10-11T02:22:30.012+03:00", "highlightTitle": ""}